#: templates/home/about.html:27
msgid ""
"Hi there! I'm a curious, creative, and passionate individual from the "
"picturesque valley of Oiartzun, nestled in the heart of the Basque Country. "
"My journey has been a blend of musical notes and lines of code. I started by"
" studying music, delving into piano and jazz, which taught me the beauty of "
"improvisation and the importance of precision in every detail."
msgstr ""
"Hi there! I'm a curious, creative, and passionate individual from the "
"picturesque valley of Oiartzun, nestled in the heart of the Basque Country. "
"My journey has been a blend of musical notes and lines of code. I started by"
" studying music, delving into piano and jazz, which taught me the beauty of "
"improvisation and the importance of precision in every detail."

#: templates/home/about.html:28
msgid ""
"However, my love for technology led me to dive into the world of computer "
"science and automation, where I discovered the joy of bringing ideas to life"
" through logic and creativity. I'm an enthusiastic web developer, dedicated "
"to crafting clean, secure, and well-structured code. I thrive on tackling "
"new technological challenges and collaborating on projects that make a "
"difference."
msgstr ""
"However, my love for technology led me to dive into the world of computer "
"science and automation, where I discovered the joy of bringing ideas to life"
" through logic and creativity. I'm an enthusiastic web developer, dedicated "
"to crafting clean, secure, and well-structured code. I thrive on tackling "
"new technological challenges and collaborating on projects that make a "
"difference."

#: templates/home/about.html:29
msgid ""
"If you have an idea or a project in mind, I’m all ears and excited to "
"explore how we can bring it to life together.For any proposals or "
"collaborations, feel free to reach out via email. I'd be delighted to hear "
"about your project, and if you’d like, we can discuss it over a good black "
"coffee – no sugar."
msgstr ""
"If you have an idea or a project in mind, I’m all ears and excited to "
"explore how we can bring it to life together.For any proposals or "
"collaborations, feel free to reach out via email. I'd be delighted to hear "
"about your project, and if you’d like, we can discuss it over a good black "
"coffee – no sugar."

#: templates/home/about.html:30
msgid "Looking forward to hearing from you!"
msgstr "Looking forward to hearing from you!"

